{"4031350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Erebus-9", "steam_appid": 4031350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience living hell in this reimagining of Dante’s Inferno as a cosmic psychological horror. Daniel Taylor is adrift. Alone. Suddenly pulled from the vast emptiness of space by a nameless voice, Daniel finds himself aboard the Erebus-9 in search of the last survivor and a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/9808b30e09f3ba29db792b138cc77376.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1125 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Daniel, you must journey through the Erebus-9 space station, hunted by the grotesque horrors that lay in wait. Clear a path through the unstable corruption that surrounds you, evade the monstrous dangers, and cling to your sanity. Your only chance at survival is to untangle the mystery of what happened here…before you succumb to the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/e7bf19cb59a6f3959ddeb60e402e0d2a.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1125 height=79 /></span><strong>DESCEND THROUGH HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Erebus-9, a gargantuan space station orbiting a blackhole, was Daedalus Industries’ flagship research facility. Explore the abandoned corridors, interact with a variety of retro-futuristic technology, and discover haunting fragments left behind by the crew, detailing life aboard. Some secrets are best left hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/06d8f97aa6da6d95655574aeb3c19d7e.poster.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/06d8f97aa6da6d95655574aeb3c19d7e.webm?t=1784188796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/06d8f97aa6da6d95655574aeb3c19d7e.mp4?t=1784188796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/d515d804d72f023cceb6cac0aa5314b9.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1125 height=79 /></span><strong>UNCOVER THE HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daedalus Industries are humanity’s leading technological innovator, a reputation they maintain by fiercely protecting their cutting edge research. Amidst the chaos of the Erebus-9, encounter unstable technology and unearth horrifying research as you uncover the true nature of Daedalus’ vision for the future of humanity. Once you lift the mask, there is no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/cc40ab4535d3a0594e63faf6db8dbb54.avif?t=1784188796\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/cc40ab4535d3a0594e63faf6db8dbb54.avif?t=1784188796 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/014c93e1b044792a435c620afabcff07.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1125 height=79 /></span><strong>END THE NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a stranger to the Erebus-9, pulled from space as you drifted helplessly, brought here by a voice without a name. Now, you must evade the horrors that stalk you, survive the nightmares in the shadows, and find the last survivor left aboard the Erebus-9. What seemed like a rescue was damnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/a7da718dab29abc05e22b88460e5d4b3.avif?t=1784188796\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras_big/a7da718dab29abc05e22b88460e5d4b3.avif?t=1784188796 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/c4ad0c0d0d154a27fa89d87bd481f23d.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1125 height=88 /></span><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling, brutalist space station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using retrofuturist technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive unspeakable horrors inspired by Dante’s Inferno</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience living hell in this reimagining of Dante’s Inferno as a cosmic psychological horror. Daniel Taylor is adrift. Alone. Suddenly pulled from the vast emptiness of space by a nameless voice, Daniel finds himself aboard the Erebus-9 in search of the last survivor and a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031350/extras/9808b30e09f3ba29db792b138cc77376.avif?t=1784188796\" width=1125 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Daniel, you must journey through the Erebus-9 space station, hunted by the grotesque horrors that lay in wait. Clear a path thro